      "description": "You land with a thump on a heap of sticks and dry leaves at the bottom of a very deep well. It is all dark overhead, and the earthen sides are filled with cupboards and book-shelves, with maps and pictures hung upon pegs; a jar labelled ORANGE MARMALADE stands empty on a shelf. Somewhere ahead a white rabbit mutters about his ears and whiskers. A long, low passage leads east.",
