    {
      "id": "mushroom-wood",
      "name": "The Mushroom Wood",
      "description": "A thick wood where the grass and the trees tower over you, for you are only three inches high. A large mushroom grows here about the same height as yourself, and on top of it sits a large blue caterpillar with its arms folded, quietly smoking a long hookah and taking not the smallest notice of anything. One side of the mushroom will make you grow taller and the other side shorter. The long hall lies west; the way east leads towards a house with chimneys shaped like ears.",
